      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Pele miró y dijo: «Ese no es un hombre. Es un cerdo, hijo de un cerdo».",
          "en": "Pele looked and said: \"That is not a man. That is a pig, and the son of a pig.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Kamapuaʻa la oyó, y su canto de amor se volvió un canto de burla.",
          "en": "Kamapuaʻa heard her, and his love song turned into a song of mockery."
        },
        {
          "es": "Le gritó que tenía los ojos rojos, como irritados por el humo, y las cejas quemadas.",
          "en": "He shouted that her eyes were red, as if sore from smoke, and her eyebrows burned away."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pele le contestó con más insultos. Así empezaban las peleas entre jefes: con palabras.",
          "en": "Pele answered with more insults. That was how fights between chiefs began: with words."
        }
      ],
