      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Entonces Pele soltó el fuego. Una nube de humo y un río de lava corrieron hacia él.",
          "en": "Then Pele let loose her fire. A cloud of smoke and a river of lava rushed at him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Kamapuaʻa apartó el humo con las manos, y quedó parado, sin una quemadura.",
          "en": "But Kamapuaʻa brushed the smoke away with his hands, and stood there without a burn."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los hermanos de Pele lo rodearon por arriba y por abajo, para ahogarlo en humo.",
          "en": "Pele's brothers surrounded him above and below, to smother him in smoke."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero un dios amigo de Kamapuaʻa los distrajo con un truco, y se fueron detrás de una mujer.",
          "en": "But a god who was Kamapuaʻa's friend distracted them with a trick, and they ran off after a woman."
        }
      ],
