      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Kamapuaʻa llamó a la lluvia. Nubes negras se juntaron sobre el cráter.",
          "en": "Kamapuaʻa called the rain. Black clouds gathered over the crater."
        },
        {
          "es": "Una hermana suya trajo niebla y aguaceros. Y cerdos, cientos de cerdos, corrieron por todas partes.",
          "en": "A sister of his brought fog and heavy rain. And pigs, hundreds of pigs, ran everywhere."
        },
        {
          "es": "El agua llenó el pozo de Pele hasta el borde.",
          "en": "Water filled Pele's pit to the brim."
        },
        {
          "es": "Uno a uno, los fuegos se apagaron. Pele casi se ahoga.",
          "en": "One by one, the fires went out. Pele almost drowned."
        },
        {
          "es": "Solo quedaban los palos de hacer fuego.",
          "en": "All that was left were the fire sticks."
        }
      ],
