      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Corrió hacia el mar, pero la lava le cortaba el camino por los dos lados.",
          "en": "He ran for the sea, but the lava cut off his path on both sides."
        },
        {
          "es": "Saltó al agua, que ya hervía. Y se volvió pez.",
          "en": "He leaped into the water, which was already boiling. And he turned into a fish."
        },
        {
          "es": "Era el humuhumunukunukuāpuaʻa, con su piel dura, para aguantar las olas calientes.",
          "en": "It was the humuhumunukunukuāpuaʻa, with its tough skin, to survive the hot waves."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pele le tiró grandes bloques de lava, y el mar se revolvió.",
          "en": "Pele hurled great lumps of lava after him, and the sea churned."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así se escapó nadando, mar adentro.",
          "en": "And so he escaped, swimming out to the deep sea."
